Z||000008||DKOV||07-30-2001||01:53 AM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by Rogue_Ant:<BR><B> <BR>Um, wouldn't covering the grills and converting the car into a hatch make it _very_ hot inside the car?  I know I can't touch my grills after my car has been running for a while.<P>Rogue<BR></B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>That was a little know fact...  The ever thoughtful designers at GM wanted the Fiero to be a Recreational vehicle at first.  It didn't work out, but they DID keep the handy BBQ Grills for the Burgers & Dogs on the run  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif"><P>DKOV -<BR>||||reg||1
