Z||000010||Fformula88||08-01-2001||05:40 PM||||First off, sorry I missed out on the event guys.  I was in Toronto on Sunday!<P>As for the hatch car, I have seen it before.  It does look really good.  I don't know how he disipates the heat.  I was most impressed with the body extension he did in the back!<P>As for the heat, he must have a way to get it out of the rear.  I would think it would get too hot for the engine in there if it had no air circulation.||||reg||1
